OL,3,GNEWSACommonwealth boxer takes first
OL,4,Astep to world title
OL,5,
OL,6,FA boxer who opted against pursuing an
OL,7,FOlympic place with Team GB says the
OL,8,Fdecision is paying off after winning
OL,9,Fthe first professional title of his
OL,10,Fcareer.
OL,12,FAaron Bowen, who won Commonwealth Games
OL,13,Fbronze in Birmingham in 2022, claimed
OL,14,Fthe Midlands super-middleweight belt
OL,15,Fwith a unanimous points victory over
OL,16,FKlinton Baptiste in Birmingham.
OL,18,FThe 27-year-old said the win marked
OL,19,Fanother step towards his ambition of
OL,20,Fbecoming a world champion.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
