OL,3,GNEWSACommonwealth boxer takes first
OL,4,Astep to world title
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's my first belt as a professional
OL,7,Fand that will be with me for life now,
OL,8,Fno-one can ever take that away from
OL,9,Fme," he said.
